# Minimal sshd config for the throwaway SCP test server -- see this
# directory's Dockerfile for why atmoz/sftp (used for the SFTP test
# server) can't be reused here: no ForceCommand, so plain `scp`/exec
# commands (what ScpTransport actually needs) work normally.
Port 22
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication no
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM no
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/ssh/sftp-server
